OL,3,GNEWSATourist tax risks creating 'uneven
OL,4,Aplaying field'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a holiday park in
OL,7,FDerbyshire has voiced concern over the
OL,8,Fprospect of a tourist tax being
OL,9,Fintroduced for visits to the county.
OL,11,FIt was confirmed on Thursday that
OL,12,Fregional mayors are set to gain new
OL,13,Fpowers to charge an uncapped levy on
OL,14,Fovernight stays for visitors.
OL,16,FBut David Brown, whose family owns Hoe
OL,17,FGrange Farm holiday accommodation near
OL,18,FMatlock said the change could lead to
OL,19,Funeven pricing if it is not applied
OL,20,Fover the border in Staffordshire.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
