OL,3,GNEWSATourist tax risks creating 'uneven
OL,4,Aplaying field'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Mayor Clare Ward said:
OL,7,F"If we want a burgeoning, growing
OL,8,Fvisitor economy in this region, which
OL,9,Fwe should have, we should be able to
OL,10,Ffund it and not ask local taxpayers
OL,11,Fto."
